    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The first family moved in January 1936, and by year’s end six affordable homes dotted the rural area now called Prospect Heights.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        14
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.prospect-heights.il.us/130/History-of-City"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1938, residents organized the Prospect Heights Improvement Association to guide the community’s growth.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        16
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.prospect-heights.il.us/130/History-of-City"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "On January 31, 1976, Prospect Heights officially incorporated, ending 40 years of unincorporated development.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.prospect-heights.il.us/130/History-of-City"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Today Prospect Heights blends half‑acre single‑family homes with growing multifamily districts and a rising business scene.",
